m","","text","",""]]},"QMP8Q":{"d":[["Distribution. According to the original description and previous collections, Microphysogobio bicolor is distributed in Xinjiang River and Raohe River, the two rivers flow into the Poyang Lake, which belong to the middle Yangtze River Basin, located in Jiangxi Province (Fig. 6). Habitat and biology. Microphysogobio bicolor inhabits the flowing water of rivers. It usually appears in areas with sandy bottoms with gravel and pebbles (Fig. 7). Coexisting species at its type locality included Pseudohemiculter hainanensis, Opsariichthys acutipinnis, Rhodeus ocellatus, Squalidus wolterstorffi, Squalidus argentatus, Sarcocheilichthys parvus, Microphysogobio zhangi, Vanmanenia maculata, Tachysurus ondon and Tachysurus aff. gracilis.","","text","",""]]},"QW2VG":{"d":[["Southern Asia","","text","",""]]},"R4GQY":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"R5T5G":{"d":[["Neotropic","","text","native",""]]},"RGPFH":{"d":[["Africa","","text","",""]]},"RLTNW":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"S2W4G":{"d":[["Europe & Northern Asia (excluding China)","","text","",""]]},"S4B95":{"d":[["Distribution. SE Europe (Caldara 2013 a)","","text","",""]]},"S5C48":{"d":[["Africa","","text","",""]]},"SBN4":{"d":[["Australia (Queensland)","","text","",""]]},"SFF8":{"d":[["","CHH-OO","tdwg","native",""],["","CHS-HN","tdwg","native",""],["","CHS-ZJ","tdwg","native",""],["China (Hainan, Hunan, Zhejiang, Zhejiang/Anhui)","","text","native",""]]},"SYCFB":{"d":[["SC, Mahé","","text","native",""]]},"T3R7G":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"TCLRB":{"d":[["Denmark","DK","iso","","not evaluated"]]},"TGWP5":{"d":[["Norway","NO","iso","native",""]]},"TNRC":{"d":[["","CM","iso","",""]]},"TYHWK":{"d":[["Distribution in Iran: Fars (Horák 1985), Iran (no locality cited) (Horák 2008). General distribution: Endemic to Iran.","","text","",""]]},"V5SFS":{"d":[["Kurile Islands","9011","mrgid","",""]]},"V7J3M":{"d":[["South China Sea","4332","mrgid","",""]]},"VBVXQ":{"d"